{
  "version": "2.0",
  "name": "skill_eval",
  "description": "自动化技能沙盒测试流水线：利用节点读取本地工作区正在开发的技能源码，分离系统与用户提示词盲测执行，再交由裁判评判。",
  "global_schema": {
    "host_skill_md_path": { "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "供读取节点使用的宿主机 SKILL.md 物理路径" },
    "workplace_dir": { "type": "string", "required": true, "description": "沙盒工作目录 /agent_vm/..." },
    "prompt": { "type": "string", "required": true },
    "expected_output": { "type": "string", "required": true }
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nd_input",
      "type": "task_input",
      "name": "全局输入",
      "position": [-500, 100],
      "config": {
        "global_vars": [
          {"name": "host_skill_md_path", "required": true},
          {"name": "workplace_dir", "required": true},
          {"name": "prompt", "required": true},
          {"name": "expected_output", "required": true}
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_read_skill",
      "type": "text_file_reader",
      "name": "读取SKILL源码",
      "position": [-200, -50],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_tpl_sys",
      "type": "template_renderer",
      "name": "组装System指令",
      "position": [100, -50],
      "config": {
        "template": "你是一个沙盒环境中的测试执行专家。\n\n【你的专属隔离工作目录】\n{{workplace_dir}}\n注意：所有的操作必须在这个目录下进行！\n\n【待测试技能 SOP 源码】\n{{skill_content}}\n\n该Skill位于 {{workplace_dir}}/SKILL.md，禁止使用 Fetch 工具再次获取该skill。\n\n💡 严格要求：你所有的测试产出和文件修改，必须真实地保存在你的工作目录内！不要仅仅在聊天中用文字回复结果，因为这只是后台测试，操作员看不到聊天记录。完成最终产出后，再调用 task_done 输出简要总结。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_msg_sys",
      "type": "message_card_builder",
      "name": "构建System卡片",
      "position": [400, -50],
      "config": { "role": "system" }
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_msg_user",
      "type": "message_card_builder",
      "name": "构建User卡片",
      "position": [400, 200],
      "config": { "role": "user" }
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_append_msgs",
      "type": "appender",
      "name": "合并消息上下文",
      "position": [700, 50],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_agent_exec",
      "type": "agent_loop",
      "name": "Agent-执行测试",
      "position": [1000, 50],
      "config": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_tpl_eval",
      "type": "template_renderer",
      "name": "组装QA裁判指令",
      "position": [1400, 150],
      "config": {
        "template": "你是一个严格的 QA 评估专家。一个 AI Agent 刚刚在沙盒中执行了某项任务。\n\n【我们期望达成的核心结果】\n{{expected_output}}\n\n【执行 Agent 的自我总结】\n{{summary}}\n\n【任务发生的工作目录】\n{{workplace_dir}}\n\n请评估上述 Agent 的执行是否完全满足了我们的期望。如果有物理文件生成的要求，你可以使用 FileSystem 工具检查该目录下的文件是否合格。评估完毕后，必须调用 task_done 工具输出严格的 JSON。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_msg_eval",
      "type": "message_card_builder",
      "name": "构建User卡片-裁判",
      "position": [1700, 150],
      "config": { "role": "user" }
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_agent_eval",
      "type": "agent_loop",
      "name": "Agent-QA裁判",
      "position": [2000, 150],
      "config": {
        "task_done_info": {
          "pass": "布尔值(True/False)，表示是否完美达到了期望",
          "reason": "字符串，给出评判的具体理由、或者指出缺陷与缺失的文件"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "nd_out",
      "type": "task_output",
      "name": "全局输出",
      "position": [2400, 100],
      "config": {
        "target_vars": [
          {"name": "exec_summary"},
          {"name": "eval_result"}
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "source": "nd_input", "target": "nd_read_skill", "sourceHandle": "host_skill_md_path", "targetHandle": "file_path" },
    
    { "source": "nd_input", "target": "nd_tpl_sys", "sourceHandle": "workplace_dir", "targetHandle": "workplace_dir" },
    { "source": "nd_read_skill", "target": "nd_tpl_sys", "sourceHandle": "file_content", "targetHandle": "skill_content" },
    { "source": "nd_tpl_sys", "target": "nd_msg_sys", "sourceHandle": "rendered_text", "targetHandle": "content" },
    
    { "source": "nd_input", "target": "nd_msg_user", "sourceHandle": "prompt", "targetHandle": "content" },
    
    { "source": "nd_msg_sys", "target": "nd_append_msgs", "sourceHandle": "message_list", "targetHandle": "base_list" },
    { "source": "nd_msg_user", "target": "nd_append_msgs", "sourceHandle": "message_list", "targetHandle": "append_list" },
    { "source": "nd_append_msgs", "target": "nd_agent_exec", "sourceHandle": "merged_list", "targetHandle": "messages" },
    
    { "source": "nd_input", "target": "nd_tpl_eval", "sourceHandle": "expected_output", "targetHandle": "expected_output" },
    { "source": "nd_input", "target": "nd_tpl_eval", "sourceHandle": "workplace_dir", "targetHandle": "workplace_dir" },
    { "source": "nd_agent_exec", "target": "nd_tpl_eval", "sourceHandle": "summary", "targetHandle": "summary" },
    { "source": "nd_tpl_eval", "target": "nd_msg_eval", "sourceHandle": "rendered_text", "targetHandle": "content" },
    { "source": "nd_msg_eval", "target": "nd_agent_eval", "sourceHandle": "message_list", "targetHandle": "messages" },
    
    { "source": "nd_agent_exec", "target": "nd_out", "sourceHandle": "summary", "targetHandle": "exec_summary" },
    { "source": "nd_agent_eval", "target": "nd_out", "sourceHandle": "summary", "targetHandle": "eval_result" }
  ]
}